Project Structure

*Backend Code: The backend Java Spring Boot code is located under src/main/java/Procurement/Master/, including Controller, DTO, Entity, Exception, Repository, Security, and Service packages.
*Frontend Code: The frontend HTML, CSS, and JavaScript files are located under src/main/resources/static/. This structure is used because the project is developed as a Spring Boot application in Eclipse.
*Agile Documentation: Agile-related documents are available under the Agile-Documentation folder.
